              "fill": "$text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Building: one polite message per milestone (\"Windows 64-bit built, 1 of 4\"), never every percent. Each app's row is a list item with a progress bar named after it.",
